{"text": "From: Thistledown Pediatric Associates Billing <billing@thistledownpeds.example>\nTo: Hye-jin Shin <hjshin.dallas@mailbox.example>\nDate: Tue, 02 Dec 2025 09:14:22 -0600\nSubject: Statement TPA-S-2291847 - balance due for Daniel\n\nDear Ms. Shin,\n\nThis is your statement for services to your son, Daniel Shin (date of birth 05/19/2016, chart no. TPA-0088417).\nYou are listed as guarantor on account G-4417-220.\n\nVISIT SUMMARY\n  10/21/2025  Dr. Fashanu  Office visit (CPT 99214), ADHD medication follow-up             $215.00\n              Behavioral screening (CPT 96127)                                              $18.00\n  11/07/2025  Babajide Fashanu, MD (NPI 1730448291)  Sick visit, rapid strep (CPT 87880) -- strep throat, positive   $164.00\n\n  Charges                                   $397.00\n  Alderney Health Plan paid                 -$201.36   (member ID AHP 884 207 119 02, group TX-55017)\n  Plan adjustment                           -$88.14\n  Copay paid at visit (11/07)                -$30.00\n  YOUR RESPONSIBILITY                       $77.50\n\nThe plan applied $47.50 of this to Daniel's deductible; claim numbers 25294-00417-A and 25311-00982-A.\n\nAUTO-PAY\nThe Mastercard on file ending in 1216 (cardholder HYE JIN SHIN, expires 11/27) will be charged $77.50\non December 16, 2025. Our last attempt to run the HSA card ending 7752 was declined on 11/24, so we have\nswitched to the Mastercard. To use a different card or pay now:\n\n  https://pay.thistledownpeds.example/s/TPA-S-2291847?t=9f3c1a7e\n\nWe will never ask for your full card number or security code by email.\n\nQuestions? Call Camille in billing at 214-555-0136, option 2, Mon-Fri 8 to 5, or reply to this message.\nIf Daniel's coverage through Alderney changes on Jan. 1, please send us the new card.\n\nCamille Beauchamp\nBilling Manager, Thistledown Pediatric Associates\n5900 Lovers Lane, Suite 204, Dallas, TX 75206-1104\nfax 214.555.0137\n\nYou have the right to a good-faith estimate under the No Surprises Act.", "kind": "Email", "detail": "260 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Hye-jin Shin", "Daniel Shin", "Camille Beauchamp"], "companies": ["Thistledown Pediatric Associates", "Thistledown Pediatric", "Alderney Health Plan"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Thistledown Pediatric Associates", "Dallas", "5900 Lovers Lane"], "health": ["ADHD medication follow-up", "Behavioral screening", "rapid strep", "strep throat", "Sick visit", "deductible"], "sensitive": ["Hye-jin Shin", "Daniel Shin", "coverage"], "names": ["Camille", "Daniel"]}, "judged": {"candidates": 0, "requests": 0, "failures": 0, "places": [], "labels": {}}, "chunks": 1, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.30000000074505806, "modelMs": 0, "topicMs": 0, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "region", "names", "sensitive_topics"], "detections": [{"start": 6, "end": 46, "text": "Thistledown Pediatric Associates Billing", "kind": "person", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "Thistledown Pediatric Associates Billing"}, {"start": 48, "end": 79, "text": "billing@thistledownpeds.example", "kind": "email", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "billing@thistledownpeds.example"}, {"start": 85, "end": 97, "text": "Hye-jin Shin", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "Hye-jin Shin"}, {"start": 99, "end": 128, "text": "hjshin.dallas@mailbox.example", "kind": "email", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "hjshin.dallas@mailbox.example"}, {"start": 136, "end": 152, "text": "Tue, 02 Dec 2025", "kind": "date", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "Tue, 02 Dec 2025"}, {"start": 187, "end": 200, "text": "TPA-S-2291847", "kind": "record", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "TPA-S-2291847"}, {"start": 219, "end": 225, "text": "Daniel", "kind": "pers